meta {
  name: Get Subscription Plans
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/subscription-plans
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # Get Subscription Plans

  Public endpoint — no token required, on purpose. The price list has to stay
  reachable for a master whose subscription has lapsed, so the app can show
  what to renew.

  Only plans with `is_active = true` are returned, ordered by `sort_order`.
  `name` and `description` are already localized for the `X-Locale` header.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      { "id": 1, "name": "1 aý", "description": null, "duration_days": 30, "price": 150.00 },
      { "id": 2, "name": "3 aý", "description": null, "duration_days": 90, "price": 400.00 }
    ]
  }
  ```

  **Note:** masters cannot buy from the app — there is no payment gateway. They
  pay the administrator in person, who then approves the profile and issues the
  subscription from the admin panel.
}
